<div id="66b50a5f"><div class="ifRGTRuVXtjJVYU0RTCC"><div class="SF3p2psDdiCPE_uxQi1X"><h2 class="kmOo1D056q7O9V6X2RE7">Kalender</h2><ul class="C2nnmo3h4d5EjyaFPXLR"><li class="GNFcXUyEY_Nb76OnN1Gm qGimXxq44ZXEer_VUZvw"><div class="G5nFpqaiV9bawp9_0BVr"><span class="f3eBwkj3s8SHLWWtYwcv">06.</span><span>oktober</span></div><ul class="fjUpoOjTsdjYGGaTaoXW"><li class="HX6wO974dMeHJIhiCO6h"><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="oEQhK8JBXLVuvQKG5RoE"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL e7uH5SSTKFAF4q1CThi9"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 375px, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=175 175w, /contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="Hc86mf7VQzuE0sjRszh3"><div class="Yfcw8ymxnbdg0OCRymJM"><h3 class="ZQjkZpCrfIoS_HGXW6SA"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/call-for-contributions-ark27-ai-as-environment---infrastructure-knowledge-operation/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi yotw7QFgjwSKmxcZyI3X" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><div>Call for contributions: AI as Environment - Infrastructure, Knowledge, Operation</div></div></a></h3><div class="Qvowk3q3ceqfi8X6O8QM"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span>Høyskolen Kristiania</div><div class="ZNqQmBQypUtT6HTMRYFA"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><time datetime="1. November, 2026">1. November, 2026</time></div></div><div class="OPIpMaIbc5uQ5TuH3O8M"><span>The 9th Annual Artistic Research at Kristiania Symposium (AR@K27) &amp; the 2nd MishMash Conference. Co-organised with AI Ecologies Research Group, Kristiania AI Centre (KAI), and Atelier Nord.</span></div></div></div></li></ul></li><li class="GNFcXUyEY_Nb76OnN1Gm oj1e8KZuzFVvXYVegiDW"><div class="G5nFpqaiV9bawp9_0BVr"><span class="f3eBwkj3s8SHLWWtYwcv">09.</span><span>oktober</span></div><ul class="fjUpoOjTsdjYGGaTaoXW"><li class="HX6wO974dMeHJIhiCO6h"><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="oEQhK8JBXLVuvQKG5RoE"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL e7uH5SSTKFAF4q1CThi9"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 375px, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=175 175w, /contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=500" alt="Portrettfoto av Janaina Pereira Lazzaretti Bull" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="Hc86mf7VQzuE0sjRszh3"><div class="Yfcw8ymxnbdg0OCRymJM"><h3 class="ZQjkZpCrfIoS_HGXW6SA"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/disputas-janaina-pereira-lazzaretti-bull/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi yotw7QFgjwSKmxcZyI3X" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><div>Disputas: Janaína Pereira Lazzaretti Bull</div></div></a></h3><div class="Qvowk3q3ceqfi8X6O8QM"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span>D502 – Kirkegata 23-25</div><div class="ZNqQmBQypUtT6HTMRYFA"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><time datetime="10:00 - 15:30">10:00 - 15:30</time></div></div><div class="OPIpMaIbc5uQ5TuH3O8M">Janaína Pereira Lazzaretti Bull forsvarer avhandlingen sin:<p></p>
<p><strong>"Examining the accessibility of tourism destination websites in Norway"</strong> for graden ph.d. i kommunikasjon og ledelse.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="HX6wO974dMeHJIhiCO6h"><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="oEQhK8JBXLVuvQKG5RoE"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL e7uH5SSTKFAF4q1CThi9"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 375px, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=175 175w, /contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="Hc86mf7VQzuE0sjRszh3"><div class="Yfcw8ymxnbdg0OCRymJM"><h3 class="ZQjkZpCrfIoS_HGXW6SA"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-09.10" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi yotw7QFgjwSKmxcZyI3X" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><div>Bibliotekkurs: Akademisk lesing og skriving</div></div></a></h3><div class="Qvowk3q3ceqfi8X6O8QM"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</div><div class="ZNqQmBQypUtT6HTMRYFA"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><time datetime="11:15-13:00">11:15-13:00</time></div></div><div class="OPIpMaIbc5uQ5TuH3O8M"><span data-contrast="none"><span>Er det vanskelig å komme i gang med oppgaveskrivingen? Hvor skal du begynne? Hva burde du lese for å komme i</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>gang?&nbsp;</span></span><p></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>Er dette spørsmål som høres kjent ut?&nbsp;Da burde du melde deg på dette </span><span>kurset om akademisk lesing og skriving!&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}">&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></li></ul></li><li class="GNFcXUyEY_Nb76OnN1Gm qGimXxq44ZXEer_VUZvw"><div class="G5nFpqaiV9bawp9_0BVr"><span class="f3eBwkj3s8SHLWWtYwcv">14.</span><span>oktober</span></div><ul class="fjUpoOjTsdjYGGaTaoXW"><li class="HX6wO974dMeHJIhiCO6h"><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="oEQhK8JBXLVuvQKG5RoE"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL e7uH5SSTKFAF4q1CThi9"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 375px, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=175 175w, /contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=500" alt="Kalenderoppslag for Kristiania-frokost med tittel &quot;Hva vet vi nå om norsk utenlandsadopsjon?&quot;" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="Hc86mf7VQzuE0sjRszh3"><div class="Yfcw8ymxnbdg0OCRymJM"><h3 class="ZQjkZpCrfIoS_HGXW6SA"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/hva-vet-vi-na-om-norsk-utenlandsadopsjon/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi yotw7QFgjwSKmxcZyI3X" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><div>Hva vet vi nå om norsk utenlandsadopsjon?</div></div></a></h3><div class="Qvowk3q3ceqfi8X6O8QM"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite